{
  "name": "network-census",
  "description": "A Rust-based utility designed for system-level auditing of installed software packages on Windows environments via the Microsoft Installer (MSI) API. The tool leverages native FFI calls and the windows-rs crate to enumerate product codes and extract granular metadata such as publisher info, versioning, and installation paths. It facilitates automated software census by serializing endpoint state into structured JSON reports for network-wide inventory management and security auditing.",
